6.a 
    Given that the propagation environment is modeled as an LTI system, we can
    apply the system to a signal by convolving it with the impulse response.
    Therefore in the case without noise, (** here means convolve)
        r[n] = s[n] ** h[n]
            => s[n] ** (a1 * Delta[n - N1] + a2 * Delta[n - N2])
            => a1 * s[n - N1] + a2 * s[n - N2]

    Physically a response signal at a time n is not instaneous as it has to 
    propogate to the object and return, aswell as the response contains interference from previous waves that it sent out.

