6.d 
    The reason for the factor of two is that the sensor measures the reflection of the signal off the object. The sound must travel from the robot to the object then from the object to the robot. So the lag is from the sound travelling twice the distance to the object.
        The computed distances are,
            d1 = 1.0993m, and d2 = 2.4027m

